Add ImageReader to host build of libandroid_runtime

Upstream: platform/frameworks/base commit 79e0a16c62e, adapted to r1

Why: the official library has the ImageReader, SurfaceImage and
PublicFormatUtils tables and exports BufferQueue::createBufferQueue and
Fence::NO_FENCE, which only this code pulls in. Adapted to the r1 files,
which have no P210 support. nativeGetFenceFd is also left out on host: the
commit keeps it, but the official SurfaceImage table has four methods and
no nativeGetFenceFd.

